- `13.00-17.00`: Collecting Logs on generated cases and filter out whether the case produces error (either in CU or DU) and keep track on which case number. Redoing log collection since the configuration files are not converted correctly from .json to .conf file. There are 36 cases that needs to be recollected. Therefore, updated the converter script for accomodating missing curly brackets and recollecting the CU, DU, and UE logs.
